  "answer": "增强方向是 CuriousLLM 作为图遍历代理增强 KGP 框架：原文明确“introduce CuriousLLM as our graph traversal agent to enhance the KGP framework”[E2:q1]，并称其“integrates a curiosity-driven reasoning mechanism into an LLM agent”以改进 KGP[E3:q1]。就 KGP 的遍历任务而言，KGP 的 LLM 图遍历代理“navigates across nodes and gathers supporting passages assisting LLMs in MD-QA”[E1:q2]；CuriousLLM 在该遍历中生成后续问题，以引导检索并连接语义不相似的段落[E2:q1, E2:q2]。Follow-upQA 的输入是“questions and supporting evidence as input”[E3:q2]，训练时“concatenate the question, the given passage, and the follow-up question”[E5:q1]。监督目标是后续问题作为真实标签：“follow-up questions serving as ground truths”[E3:q2]，模型以“next-token prediction”为目标微调[E5:q1]。证据充分信号是：后续问题“use special tokens to signify that the retrieved evidence is sufficient”[E3:q2]；模型被训练为在收集足够证据时生成终止信号“NA”[E6:q1]，遍历持续到“the model deems it has sufficient information to answer the query”[E5:q2]。",
